pl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--info obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h1>武器数据</h1> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/05/19/282941837/5ef0e9735ad6d6a00eb57e334ba0f676_2045109862530498634.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">439</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">21</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">迅捷的招式源于精心设计，完美的出击来自长久练习。陪伴少女穿越世界的双枪，是她值得信赖的应援者，亦是偶像赤诚之心的明证：</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\">「这份闪闪发光的心意，终有一天会传递给每个人！☆」</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">与星的交映</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:15秒]<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">双枪高速旋转发射两枚弧线子弹，在目标处对撞爆炸造成650.0％攻击力的冰冻元素伤害。糖露星霜使用时，会先朝前方扇形区域发射一排冰冻子弹，造成250.0％攻击力的冰冻元素伤害。角色对敌人造成武器技伤害时施加【饴音】标记，持续10秒，重复触发刷新持续时间，同时全队角色造成的全伤害提高16.0％（该效果唯一生效），持续10秒，重复触发刷新持续时间。糖露星霜使用时，角色必杀技、蓄力攻击命中敌人时额外造成80％攻击力的冰冻元素伤害，QTE技能额外造成120％攻击力的冰冻元素伤害</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">与梦的同行</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">全队冰冻元素伤害提高18.0％（该效果唯一生效），自身冰冻元素伤害提高25.0％。糖露星霜使用时，普通攻击（包含蓄力攻击）命中【饴音】标记下的敌人造成伤害时额外回复5.0点能量，冷却时间5秒，必杀技释放的每发射击命中敌人额外附加6点冻结积蓄值</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">与你的共鸣</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">角色全伤害提高20.0%， QTE、分支和蓄力、必杀技伤害命中【饴音】标记下的敌人时会造成一次爆炸，对5米范围内的敌人造成100.0%攻击力的冰冻元素伤害，并回复全队30.0生命值，每种伤害类型触发该效果有5秒冷却时间。糖露星霜使用时， 【饴音】标记下敌人受到的冰冻元素伤害提高10%</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"forging\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--forging obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>悬赏锻造</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">超限素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/2494/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/05/19/282941837/4a0acd1ff96da11886741ff4e71cc130_4333842728609816408.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">解锁「星河舞曲」图鉴后任意双枪蛋池武器</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">其他素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-other-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1274/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">爱因斯坦环磁机</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*100</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1140/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">超导金属氢</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*50</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1890/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">流体合金块</span></a> <span class=